    label: 'Bayou water ≠ beach water — price accordingly',
    value: 'Waterfront here means rivers, bayous, and marsh — world-class for fishing and kayaking, different from sand-beach frontage. It insures differently, appraises differently, and attracts a different buyer. Know which waterfront you\'re buying and which buyer you\'ll resell to.',
